      "writtenOn": "2020-05-26T23:28:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think using mpu_config_region is the right thing to do here, since there is logic there that will fail with certain regions (such as checks for reserved regions). Using this depends on the hidden knowledge that a power-of-2 region size works, whereas any other size will not.\nI think you should be using the original change with the fixed size (i.e use mpu_update_region instead)",
